2026-07-27T08:24:22.9014456Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9074465Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9075053Z i /tmp/RtmpaixEgz/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9075446Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9075906Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9076564Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9077206Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9078140Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9078848Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9323318Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9430064Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:22.9852127Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:23.0007562Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
